[{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0000","text":"旁白"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0010","text":"伫立在街角的咖啡店『片刻时光』\n店长和店员，今天也在认真地工作着"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0001","text":"旁白"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0020","text":"然而……\n客席上，人影稀疏……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0002","text":"店长。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0030","text":"好闲啊～……\n好不容易推出了季节新品，却没人点……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0003","text":"店员"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0040","text":"店长做的……水果挞……\n明明那么好吃……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0004","text":"店长。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0050","text":"对吧～？\n是我的得意之作来着……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0005","text":"店员"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0060","text":"────……\n要是……能让更多人知道……很好吃就好了……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0006","text":"店员"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0070","text":"有没有什么……\n能做的事呢……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0007","text":"店长。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0080","text":"嗯～……怎么说呢……\n有人跟我说过要不要试试SNS……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0008","text":"店长。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0090","text":"我对那个不太熟啊～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0009","text":"店员"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0100","text":"嗯……但是……\n试试看……也许也不错……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0011","text":"店长。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0110","text":"……也是呢，一开始大家都是新手嘛！\n总之先试试看吧……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0111","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0012","text":"店长。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0120","text":"『京草站前，咖啡店片刻时光！』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0013","text":"店长。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0130","text":"『新菜单，季节水果满满的水果挞欢迎品尝！\n　我们备好了虹吸咖啡恭候光临！』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0131","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0014","text":"店长。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0140","text":"嗯！照片也好好地传上去了～！\n这样客人应该就会来了吧～！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0141","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0142","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0015","text":"店员"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0150","text":"啊……店长……\n有评论……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0151","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0016","text":"回复"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0160","text":"『看起来很好吃，不过咖啡店在哪里呢？\n　想知道具体位置和挞的价格』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0161","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0017","text":"店长。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0170","text":"诶……对哦，也是呢～……\n不好好写清楚的话，客人没法来呢～？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0018","text":"店员"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0180","text":"嗯……\n再好好写一次……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0181","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0019","text":"店长。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0190","text":"虽然挺难的，但像这样被人询问，\n总觉得心里暖暖的呢～"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0021","text":"店长。"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01020100_01_0200","text":"加油吧！"}]
